  "word_count": 1222,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n# Smile Makeover\n\n\n\n# Smile Makeover - Los Angeles, CA\n\n\n\n## Get a Picture-Perfect Smile\n\n\n\n## From Flawed to Flawless\n\n\nHave broken, missing, or stained teeth made you feel self-conscious and too embarrassed to smile and laugh openly? Your smile plays a big role in how attractive you feel and can have a significant impact on your self-esteem, social experiences, and professional life. If you’re in this situation, our cosmetic dentist offers personalized and transformative smile makeovers in Los Angeles, CA. Our team at West LA Implants has extensive cosmetic dentistry training and is experienced in personalized smile makeover treatment. Partnering with leading insurance providers as well as third-party financing companies, we craft treatment plans that consider your esthetic and financial needs alike. We’re here to help restore your confidence and attractiveness so you can live an active and happy life!\n\nGet Pricing\n\n\n## The Steps of a Smile Transformation\n\n\nOur smile makeover treatments in Los Angeles, CA are designed to restore the cosmetic appearance of your healthy teeth. During your consultation, our cosmetic dentist will learn about the smile you envision and your esthetic and oral health goals with treatment. Then, we’ll complete an examination of your oral structures and evaluate digital imaging to create a customized treatment plan. This plan not only improves the look of each individual tooth but creates a symmetrical smile that complements your facial esthetics, lips, and even skin tone.\n\nThen, using high-quality and natural-looking materials alongside advanced technology, we complete your treatments with artistry and technical skill. The length of your treatment will be determined by the extent of your cosmetic tooth flaws and the types of treatment you’ll need to restore full smile esthetics. Once your treatment is complete, your flawless and beautiful smile will be revealed! With proper at-home hygiene care and professional dental appointments, you will be able to enjoy a gorgeous smile, improved confidence, and better oral health long-term.\n\n\n## Select Smile Makeover Treatments\n\n\n\n#### Dental Crowns\n\n\nDental crowns are porcelain “caps” that cover your natural tooth. They can dramatically improve aesthetics like color, size, and shape of a tooth while also restoring strength and function as well. Crowns can also be used after root canal therapy and to restore a dental implant.\n\n\n#### Dental Bridges\n\n\nDental bridges are a series of porcelain dental crowns that replace one or more missing teeth in a row. They attach to one or both teeth on either side of the empty tooth socket(s) to replace aesthetics and function to the area and restore a complete smile after tooth loss.\n\n\n#### Porcelain Veneers\n\n\nIf you have cosmetic flaws like gaps, chips, crookedness, and discoloration we offer porcelain veneers in Los Angeles, CA to treat all of these at once. Each veneer is a thin shell that covers the front surface of a single tooth. Dental veneers require a minimal amount of tooth enamel to be removed so they fit naturally alongside each other or existing teeth.\n\n\n#### Teeth Whitening\n\n\nProfessional teeth whitening can brighten teeth multiple shades whiter in just a single session! Our professional-grade treatment in Los Angeles, CA penetrates deep into the inner layers of your teeth to remove deep stains alongside surface-level stains. Teeth whitening from our cosmetic dentist is personalized and monitored for stunning, long-term results.\n\n\n#### Orthodontics\n\n\nBraces use metal brackets and wires to straighten crooked teeth by strategically applying torque and pressure. From minor gapped or crooked teeth to severely misaligned bites, our orthodontic options can provide significant cosmetic results. Braces often take a few months to a few years to completely align teeth depending on your unique case.\n\n\n#### Invisalign®\n\n\nInvisalign® orthodontics is a series of clear plastic aligners used to straighten crooked teeth. They are virtually invisible when worn, making them a popular solution with social teens and professional adults alike. Invisalign aligners are removable so you can eat what you want and maintain proper oral hygiene with ease.\n\n\n#### Occlusal Adjustment\n\n\nAn occlusal adjustment helps create a harmonious bite for teeth that don’t fit together properly (malocclusion). This treatment involves altering the surfaces of the problem teeth so the pressure and force when biting and chewing are distributed evenly. Occlusal adjustments help reduce teeth grinding and clenching, jaw pain, and headaches, while also protecting other cosmetic dentistry treatments you receive.\n\n\n#### Composite Fillings\n\n\nComposite fillings are the metal-free alternative to amalgam fillings that are similarly durable but have greater aesthetics. Composite is naturally tooth-colored, so the filling will blend with your tooth. They can replace metal fillings to eliminate the noticeable gray or black spots on teeth.\n\n\n#### Inlays and Onlays\n\n\nInlays and onlays fix teeth with moderate damage that does not require a dental crown. Inlays rest inside the molars, between the cusps, and often restore a tooth after a large cavity is treated. Onlays are custom-made to replace a larger portion of a tooth, usually involving one or more cusps.\n\n10\n\n\n#### Crown Lengthening\n\n\nA “gummy” smile is when too much gum tissue covers over the tooth crowns and creates a disproportionate tooth-to-gum ratio. Crown lengthening reshapes the gums around the teeth in a more symmetrical and aesthetic way. This procedure may also be completed to access areas of the tooth that have decay.\n\n11\n\n\n#### Dental Implants\n\n\nDental implants in Los Angeles, CA permanently replace one or more missing teeth to restore normal function and natural esthetics. Implants are considered the “gold standard” in tooth replacement due to their superior strength and longevity. They also provide the greatest health benefits by being secured in the jawbone.\n\nView More Results\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\n\n### Complete this short smile Evaluation and receive the following:\n\n\nIf you're a good candidate for veneers\n\nDigital Smile Design to show you what you will look like with your new veneers!\n\nPricing and options for treatment\n\nAnd best of all... a time to speak directly with Dr. Tony C. Barriere. Top Cosmetic Dentists in Los Angeles, CA!\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
